# RegAsm.EXE Initiating Network Connection To Public IP | T1218.009 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/network_connection/net_connection_win_regasm_network_activity.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=3 Initiated="true" Image="*\\regasm.exe" NOT (DestinationIp="127.0.0.0/8" OR DestinationIp="10.0.0.0/8" OR DestinationIp="172.16.0.0/12" OR DestinationIp="192.168.0.0/16" OR DestinationIp="169.254.0.0/16" OR DestinationIp="::1/128" OR DestinationIp="fe80::/10" OR DestinationIp="fc00::/7")
